,{"text":"Each of the 13 MFQ-Parent items are scored 0 (not true), 1 (sometimes), or 2 (true), reflecting","bbox":[91.03939,201.95059,547.70453,212.95059],"origin":[91.03939,210.45007],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"the frequency of depressive symptoms observed in the child over the past 2 weeks. The sum of","bbox":[91.03939,214.05057,554.46948,225.05057],"origin":[91.03939,222.55005],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"responses to all items produces a total score ranging from 0 to 26. Higher scores indicate","bbox":[91.03939,226.15054,525.11041,237.15054],"origin":[91.03939,234.65002],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"greater severity of depressive symptoms.","bbox":[91.03939,238.25052,291.54736,249.25052],"origin":[91.03939,246.75],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"The established total cut-off score of 11 and above indicates the presence of significant","bbox":[91.03939,262.45053,515.37537,273.45053],"origin":[91.03939,270.95001],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"depressive symptoms that warrant further evaluation. This threshold was established by Thapar","bbox":[91.03939,274.55051,555.66852,285.55051],"origin":[91.03939,283.04999],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"and McGuffin (1998) and demonstrates good sensitivity and specificity for identifying youth with","bbox":[91.03939,286.65048,553.85345,297.65048],"origin":[91.03939,295.14996],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"depressive disorders. The total score is also presented in comparison to a community sample of","bbox":[91.03939,298.75046,557.49445,309.75046],"origin":[91.03939,307.24994],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"children (aged 6-8), and a clinical sample (aged 11-13) who met diagnostic criteria for","bbox":[91.03939,310.85043,506.75131,321.85043],"origin":[91.03939,319.34991],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"depression.","bbox":[91.03939,322.95044,147.89838,333.95044],"origin":[91.03939,331.44992],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"The MFQ-Parent can be used for monitoring symptom changes over time during treatment.","bbox":[91.03939,347.15045,533.65735,358.15045],"origin":[91.03939,355.64993],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Research examining meaningful score changes suggests a 2-point change in either direction","bbox":[91.03939,359.25046,541.63245,370.25046],"origin":[91.03939,367.74994],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"represents a noticeable shift in symptom severity.","bbox":[91.03939,371.35046,331.90637,382.35046],"origin":[91.03939,379.84995],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"On first administration, a bar graph displaying the total raw score is presented. When the","bbox":[91.03939,395.55048,521.44745,406.55048],"origin":[91.03939,404.04996],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"assessment is administered multiple times, a longitudinal line graph is generated to track","bbox":[91.03939,407.65048,522.04138,418.65048],"origin":[91.03939,416.14996],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"changes in the total raw score over time.","bbox":[91.03939,419.75049,288.51135,430.75049],"origin":[91.03939,428.24997],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Client Responses","bbox":[34.34639,461.00906,151.82039,475.00906],"origin":[34.34639,471.82657],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0